Package: ggstackedsurv
Title: Stacked Probability Plots for Mutli-State Survival Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Facilitate the creation of stacked probabity plots for multi-state survival models with `ggplot2`. Each function from the package creates a proper `ggplot2` object that can be modified with any function from the `ggplot2` or any of its extensions.
